  "analysis_md": "设 $A=(x,y,z)$，则 $\\overrightarrow{AB}=(2-x,-1-y,7-z)$。由投影条件得 $2-x=4$，$-1-y=-4$，$7-z=7$，解得 $A=(-2,3,0)$。",
